    "title": "Money App - Cash Advance",
    "description": "If you have a consistent direct deposit into your bank account, you can access your next direct deposit early with Money App. Get cash for groceries, gas, rent, bills, and other necessities when you need it.\r\n\r\nMoney App offers cash delivered right to your personal bank account.\r\n\r\nNo Interest\r\nNo Tipping\r\nNo Hidden Fees\r\nNo Membership Fees\r\nNo Late Fees\r\nNo Credit Check\r\n\r\nA Money App Cash Advance has a 0% Annual Percentage Rate (APR) and no mandatory fees. You may pay an optional fee for expedited funds delivery. For a $40 advance with an Express Delivery fee of $4.99, your repayment amount will be $44.99. Money App cash advance is a non-recourse product, not a personal loan, and there is no mandatory minimum or maximum timeframe for repayment; you will not be eligible to request a new advance until your outstanding balance is paid. See Cash Advance Agreement and http://cash.money.app for additional terms, conditions and eligibility requirements.",
